{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：23:00 2026-07-28 HKT</p>\n\n<p>「屯門娜娜」董幸兒昔日在屯門公園以賣唱表演而聞名，一度成為話題人物，近年她已成功轉型，從公園演出搖身一變成為KOL，更曾挑戰《中年好聲音》的舞台，積極提升知名度。近日董幸兒在社交平台上分享了與兒子享受親子假期的溫馨影片，更大方換上性感比堅尼泳衣，逼爆上圍展露無遺，與兒子嬉水時亦不慎露出側乳，再次引發網民熱議，而且這次的焦點，不僅是她的性感身材，還有她作為媽媽溫柔的一面。</p>\n<h2>屯門娜娜董幸兒穿比堅尼晒澎湃上圍</h2>\n<p>在影片中，董幸兒與年幼的兒子在一個室內水上樂園中嬉戲，享受著無憂無慮的親子時光。她身穿一套極為搶眼的藍黑色蝴蝶圖案比堅尼，但她成為人母後，董幸兒的上圍再次躍升，而她身上的比堅尼尺碼，根本遮蓋不住她的豐滿上圍，只是曾經生育的她，小腹難免有點膩肉，每次她彎腰照顧兒子時，都會有點三疊肉的尷尬情況，而她身上搶眼的紋身，亦多次吸引到其他泳客的目光。</p>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜有仔萬事足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/19378595e5d857e59383b8ff593b9ddf/2026-01/nana_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜是不少伯伯心目中的女神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49802e1f595eff3734ebd6283a435936/2023-01/296144653_782638212749052_6288123384386440498_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜曾入圍《中年好聲音》100強。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25403737594a3831f66047fe8998710e/2022-11/1_17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜入圍《中年好聲音》100強，Happy伯遠赴將軍澳支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d41f1201ae9e3fb87613c7b5e37d7c9e/2022-11/7_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜2023年1月突然報喜，宣佈成為人妻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9011eeda5bf7a0aa958bfea600b45aa6/2023-01/321644661_1130839870953918_8032706765616992380_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民指娜娜老公迪康似Anson Lo，一樣咁靚仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f2d2b05bba091a754bb3c9792978264/2023-01/pic_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜結婚時，Happy伯曾到賀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe28a26365c83cf571f958abed681abe/2023-01/kA4dF2d.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜已為人妻人母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ce2085845e1bd219a1691b303eba0c9/2026-01/nana_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜去旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1412daa25d61f33e21fdbc8287aea4e8/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946553909879449_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜大晒旅遊照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e93539ec35bc74890a3f5ad7f01c6d8/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946553968634335_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜成為人母依舊性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14b89c544bb990e81efa5a44c5f6696a/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946554690044263_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜分享泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff180b890918175dfc9b2b34b3e1095c/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946562172684298_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜出位風格曾引爭議。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7cf075b6036e9b4287b22c0df72895d1/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946573346305474_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜一直受到Happy伯的愛戴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2146117ab039133959555b2ca4969565/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946574462015933_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜舉手投足依然充滿自信。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ed32cc9700ae9b09628c5aec0e31c0b/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946574805897872_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜雖然更新IG的頻率大減，但她出位的風格從未改變。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9140fea98338f4893b6702539f966a0d/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946554690021557_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜分享了一系列與家人外遊的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d51c18dd2a49a85d85f6faa014c9329e/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946541637401704_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜榮升人母的她身材依然火辣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f36b425f2ab6da43132ddb4936c84f5/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946544464309661_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜大方穿比堅尼上陣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6103d10a975a3d3a563ce3bc9fa00a9d/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946547375145338_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜腹部、胸前及大腿的紋身亦相當搶鏡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f65338c303bb29e990f63ef0e88ad975/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946549120009715_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜毫不吝嗇地展示其姣好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c028a2e84033f362bf0f3e7915529c0/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946550302796296_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜穿上性感比堅尼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bcdb25732a833c39daf74a62a5d2b97c/2026-02/nananananana0125_1772096549_3840946550621540905_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜樂也融融晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3147a847ab12ef734881e93a0115eeee/2026-02/3_4_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜享受了一趟溫馨的家庭旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/78475d5ab41fe59ee12215d10e831be8/2026-02/4_4_15.jpg\"/>\n<h2>屯門娜娜董幸兒專注陪兒子嬉水</h2>\n<p>儘管董幸兒穿上性感比堅尼，但她的焦點一直落在兒子身上，無論是陪著兒子玩巨大的紫色水球，還是細心地將兒子放入水泡中，她臉上也是掛著燦爛的笑容，眼神從未離開過兒子。其中一幕，她輕輕推著兒子的水泡，在水中緩緩前行，囝囝興奮地拍打著水花，整個畫面充滿溫馨治癒。董幸兒從昔日街頭表演者，到2023年結婚，翌年誕下兒子，她的人生邁入了新的階段。網民紛紛指她除了在台上賣唱搵食外，她也是一位不折不扣的慈母。</p>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜早年在屯門公園勁歌熱舞的影片當時在網上廣傳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e9f80fccfacc88bb1d3a90c22f7a5179/2022-11/2019_tuenmun%20%286%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜與忠實粉絲Happy伯成為網絡紅人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3cf08db3420957a51842e7bb4bbad3e0/2022-11/2019_tuenmun%20%282%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Happy伯的地板動作好經典。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/27f5c71040994978c961e2ed8b20dae1/2022-11/2019_tuenmun%20%283%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜向來形象性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bae8ce5fa3b0c22c685f80736bd3a407/2023-01/292273088_185626770560869_7149478448868078461_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜早前分享帶兒子度假的照片，相中見到她身後舒適的度假屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3fe8ddfbccffa349c9bbcb0510738dde/2026-04/3867687843401761087_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜穿上性感比堅尼，但卻正在茶几上泡茶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0acda71dead20ea24d11e87f3051c372/2026-04/3867687850716629150_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜在池邊餵錦鯉，氣氛好寧靜舒服。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c999789e961bc49f428534e98ff8b95a/2026-04/3867687857016536238_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜在私人泳池邊，大曬日光浴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ada28ac9a1b338a11ab5a1b9d7b8308d/2026-04/3867687860598458279_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜平日辛苦賣唱，換來放假的舒適生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9fb5f716bf0aecc2e7442ed374b48fe/2026-04/3867687861957388537_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜大晒比堅尼，身材惹火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd181b995ac2a7dc11f4dea9bd015d11/2026-04/3867687865925228512_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜身上有不少獨特紋身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fcedf2968f7db843a6e15a497b908aab/2026-04/3867687870304027237_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜大晒身材外，身後見到有一位女子幫她照顧囝囝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5bdaecbd5fe06113ee2acfefe5cb61e6/2026-04/3867687876998137914_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜擁有修長美腿，俘虜不少男士。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28e97d56ebe25bde9eadbd9428cd552a/2026-04/3867687878164187817_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜拍下不少靚相，但卻一直未見老公現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53b13b284df244bbd62f06e67b9c5e29/2026-04/3867687880722717334_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜在泳池晒誇張身材，大派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/43deedffbb55acc5fe6bf75962af9693/2026-04/3867687883717461047_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜跟囝囝溫馨互動，她也有廿四孝媽媽的一面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d16fd18f13022f8bb44866d0ec562f5f/2026-04/3867687885688743784_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜在洗手間，也要打卡拍照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c6326c1027439071679a6dd3f63dfe4/2026-04/3867687888113067086_1625746722.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜IG有不少大膽性感相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46ee05d3f146a5f4cb64fb8dced704a4/2023-01/315751263_171340962212062_1626430232839552398_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜的Pose好大膽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56dbbd79eb761eb3e63a8c1a40e56c61/2023-01/294994294_1401862490311716_427067805443610919_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜在IG晒三點式泳裝照，造型非常性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38212aad7d4bc84e3ccfd97af69c7846/2024-05/nananananana0125_1714905977_3361197411942496427_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜上下身都僅靠兩條繩綁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/113bda3d559ba83c1c44d8b5a7f30b3e/2024-05/nananananana0125_1714905977_3361197411934054116_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屯門娜娜甫士好誘人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6a617c587565606dc2f48b43cd720c0/2024-05/nananananana0125_1714905977_3361197411942503685_1625746722.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T15:18:59.682314+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":612,"images":46,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}